                <pb facs="0670" n="572" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg572"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram in cipher—paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-01-24"><hi rendition="#italic">January 24,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Hay inquires whether Mr. Choate needs a certified copy of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Mashona’s</hi> manifest, received by the Department of
                    State from the collector of customs at New York?]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
